{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"一、元年。春王。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"定何以無正月？正月者，正即位也。定無正月者，即位後也。即位何以後？昭公在外，得入不得入，未可知也。曷為未可知？在季氏也。定、哀多微辭，主人習其讀而問其傳，則未知己之有罪焉爾。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"二、三月，晉人執宋仲幾于京師。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"仲幾之罪何？不蓑城也。其言于京師何？伯討也。伯討則其稱人何？貶。曷為貶？不與大夫專執也。曷為不與？實與而文不與。文曷為不與？大夫之義，不得專執也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"三、夏六月癸亥，公之喪至自乾侯。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"四、戊辰，公即位。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"癸亥公之喪至自乾侯，則曷為以戊辰之日，然後即位？正棺於兩楹之間，然後即位。子沈子曰：「定君乎國，然後即位。」即位不日，此何以日？錄乎內也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"五、秋七月癸巳，葬我君昭公。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"六、九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"七、立煬宮。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"煬宮者何？煬公之宮也。立者何？立者不宜立也。立煬宮，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"八、冬十月，霣霜殺菽。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_213_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_213","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。此災菽也，曷為以異書？異大乎災也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}